description	"The Mandalorian Sniper

Based on open mode's Mandalorian class, this version features a fully upgraded ee-4 blaster and a projectile rifle. It is more specialized for sniping but still effective at other ranges.

^2Weaponry:
- Dual Westar Pistols (3)
- EE-4 Carbine Rifle (3)
- Projectile Rifle
- Jetpack Rocket ^3[CS1]
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS2 Toggle]
- Flamethrower ^3[CS2 Toggle]

^8Attributes:
- Fuel (3)
- Regenerating Fuel (1)

^3Abilities:
- Jetpack

^2Strengths^7: Well armored, Mobile, effective at all ranges, and formidable against jedi.
^1Weaknesses^7: Vulnerable to the SBD, Killbot, and especially Chaingunner classes."